        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Jones, Harvey Schmidt\n- Works: The Fantasticks, The Fantasticks (film)\n- Productions: off-Broadway production, off-Broadway revival\n- Places: Littlefield, Texas\n- Roles: American lyricist, librettist\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Jones was born in 1928 in Littlefield, Texas.\n- Tom Jones is an American lyricist and often a librettist of musical theatre.\n- Tom Jones and Harvey Schmidt wrote the screenplay for The Fantasticks (film).\n- The screenplay for The Fantasticks (film) is based on Tom Jones and Harvey Schmidt's off-Broadway production The Fantasticks.\n- The off-Broadway production The Fantasticks ran for 17,162 performances.\n- The off-Broadway production The Fantasticks was subsequently revived off-Broadway.",
